{{define "voice"}}{{template "head" .}}
<section class="card bot" aria-labelledby="voice-h">
<div class="bot-head">
{{template "ada"}}
<div>
<h1 id="voice-h">Record Ada's voice</h1>
<p class="bot-line">The voice recorded here becomes mine. It stays on this computer: nothing is sent anywhere.</p>
</div>
</div>
<p class="bot-buttons"><button type="button" id="voice-folder" class="primary">Choose a folder</button> <span id="voice-folder-name" class="muted small">The takes are saved in a folder you pick; picking it again carries on where you stopped.</span></p>
<p class="bot-buttons"><button type="button" id="voice-mode-read" aria-pressed="true">Read the lines</button> <button type="button" id="voice-mode-talk" aria-pressed="false">Just record me</button></p>
<p id="voice-warn" class="notice warn" hidden></p>
</section>
<section class="card" id="voice-read" aria-labelledby="read-h">
<h2 id="read-h">Read the lines</h2>
<p class="muted small" id="voice-count"></p>
<p class="voice-line" id="voice-line" aria-live="polite"></p>
<p class="bot-buttons">
<button type="button" id="voice-rec" class="primary">Record (Space)</button>
<button type="button" id="voice-play" disabled>Play back (P)</button>
<button type="button" id="voice-keep" disabled>Keep (Enter)</button>
<button type="button" id="voice-retake" disabled>Retake (R)</button>
<button type="button" id="voice-prev">Back</button>
<button type="button" id="voice-skip">Skip (S)</button>
</p>
<p class="voice-level"><meter id="voice-meter" min="0" max="1" low=".15" high=".9" optimum=".6" value="0"></meter> <span id="voice-note" class="muted small"></span></p>
</section>
<section class="card" id="voice-talk" aria-labelledby="talk-h" hidden>
<h2 id="talk-h">Just record me</h2>
<p>Start, then talk for as long as you like: to someone, to yourself, or to ChatGPT's voice mode. Wear headphones, so that only your voice reaches the microphone; only your side is kept. A file is saved every five minutes and when you stop.</p>
<p class="bot-buttons"><button type="button" id="voice-talk-rec" class="primary">Start</button> <span id="voice-talk-time" class="muted"></span></p>
<p class="voice-level"><meter id="voice-talk-meter" min="0" max="1" low=".15" high=".9" optimum=".6" value="0"></meter> <span id="voice-talk-note" class="muted small"></span></p>
</section>
<details class="card"><summary>How to record well</summary>
<ul>
<li>A quiet room with soft things in it: curtains, a bed, a wardrobe of clothes. No fan, heater or open window; phones on silent.</li>
<li>The microphone 15 to 20 cm from your mouth, a little to the side, in the same place every time.</li>
<li>Your natural voice, calm and clear, at an even pace: the way I should sound. A short pause before and after each line.</li>
<li>Stumbled? Press R and read the whole line again. Twenty minutes at a time, with water to hand.</li>
<li>About an hour in all makes a good voice. The meter should sit in the middle; the page says when a take is too quiet or too loud.</li>
</ul>
